stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> active : created (UC-001, UC-008, UC-010)
    active --> deactivated : parent deactivates, all sessions ended (200)
    active --> active : last active parent, 422 BUSINESS_LAST_ACTIVE_PARENT
    deactivated --> deactivated : deactivate again, 409 already deactivated
    deactivated --> active : parent reactivates (UC-015)
